h belong to lignans and are known for their cholesterol-lowering and antioxidant properties. These compounds help regulate blood pressure and boost vitamin E levels, making sesame seeds an ideal choice for the <\/span><b>health food industry<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">.<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Choose <\/span><b>Bombay Foodstuff Natural Sesame Seeds<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> for unmatched purity, consistency, and quality, trusted by bakeries, food processors, and bulk buyers worldwide.<\/span><\/p>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Bombay Foodstuff Natural Sesame Seeds (White) are premium-grade Sesamum indicum seeds, rich in nutrients and flavor. Extensively used in bakery, confectionery, health foods, and culinary applications, our sesame seeds are cholesterol-free and packed with minerals, vitamins, and lignans (sesamin, sesamolin). Ideal for bulk buyers, food processors, and exporters seeking consistent purity, taste, and quality.<\/span><\/p>\n","protected":false},"featured_media":1197,"comment_status":"open","ping_status":"closed","template":"","meta":{"_acf_changed":false},"product_brand":[],"product_cat":[25],"product_tag":[],"class_list":["post-820","product","type-product","status-publish","has-post-thumbnail","product_cat-uncategorized","first","instock","shipping-taxable","product-type-simple"],"acf":[],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/bombayfoodstuff.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/product\/820","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/bombayfoodstuff.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/product"}],"about":[{"href":"https:\/\/bombayfoodstuff.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/product"}],"replies":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/bombayfoodstuff.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/comments?post=820"}],"wp:featuredmedia":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/bombayfoodstuff.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media\/1197"}],"wp:attachment":[{"href":"https:\/\/bombayfoodstuff.com\/wp-